OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidespread dense fog will be
OL,6,Fslow to clear on Monday morning, but
OL,7,Fsome sunny spells gradually
OL,8,Fdeveloping. Perhaps isolated coastal
OL,9,Fshowers in Essex. Feeling cool,
OL,10,Fespecially where fog lingers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry evening is expected,
OL,13,Fwith clear spells developing, allowing
OL,14,Fsome mist, fog and frost patches to
OL,15,Fdevelop during the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FAreas of fog will be slow to
OL,18,Fclear on Tuesday morning. Some
OL,19,Fbrightness developing before cloud
OL,20,Fthickens in the afternoon, ahead of
OL,21,Frain arriving later. Turning breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
